\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 CDISC SDTM/ADaM Pilot \'96 SAS Programming Exercise\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This project independently rebuilds datasets from the CDISC SDTM/ADaM Pilot (study CDISCPILOT01) in SAS, starting from raw data in the pharmaverseraw R package (v0.1.1), and validates each result against the official CDISC Pilot datasets using PROC COMPARE.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Status:
\f1\b0  Phase 1 (SDTM DM) complete. Phases 2\'964 (ADaM ADSL, SDTM AE, ADaM ADAE) are planned.\

\f0\b Documentation:
\f1\b0  See the documentation PDF for the project background, program descriptions and validation results, including an analysis of the RFPENDTC differences.\

\f0\b Data:
\f1\b0  Input data is not included. The raw data comes from the pharmaverseraw R package (
\f2\fs26 install.packages("pharmaverseraw")
\f1\fs24 ), and the reference datasets come from the CDISC Pilot repository ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/cdisc-org/sdtm-adam-pilot-project"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://github.com/cdisc-org/sdtm-adam-pilot-project}}). Update the 
\f2\fs26 home_path
\f1\fs24  macro variable at the top of each program to point to your project folder.\
}